  "content": "<p>New in Mastodon 4.6: Newsletters 📬</p><p>Mastodon servers now support email newsletters, which allow people without a social web account to subscribe to your posts via email. This feature is opt-in at the server level.</p><p>We&#39;re building Mastodon for people and institutions that want independence from corporate-controlled social networks, so they can reach their audience directly wherever those people are. </p><p>Explore Mastodon 4.6&#39;s other new features: <a href=\"https://blog.joinmastodon.org/2026/06/mastodon-4.6/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">blog.joinmastodon.org/2026/06/</span><span class=\"invisible\">mastodon-4.6/</span></a></p>",
